            "heading": "We started with one stubborn question",
            "heading_size": "h1"
          }
        },
        "intro_text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Why is it so hard to find a bake you can enjoy without reading the label twice? Nutrilae began with that question, and a kitchen determined to answer it — with cakes, buns, breads and muffins made the way we would want them made for our own families.</p>",
            "text_style": "body"
          }
        }
